flowchart TD
    Raw[Raw Answer] --> Norm[Normalize Text]
    Norm --> Empty{Is Empty?}
    Empty -- YES --> ScoreZero[Score = 0]
    ScoreZero --> Feedback[Generate Feedback]
    
    Empty -- NO --> Concept[Concept Coverage - 45%]
    Concept --> Quality[Answer Quality - 25%]
    Quality --> Structure[Structure & Clarity - 20%]
    Structure --> Comm[Communication - 10%]
    Comm --> Weighted[Weighted Score]
    Weighted --> Clamp[Round and Clamp 0-100]
    Clamp --> Feedback
    Feedback --> Display[Display Feedback]
